@startuml Device Command Sequence
!include https://raw.githubusercontent.com/plantuml-stdlib/C4-PlantUML/master/C4_Component.puml

title Последовательность выключения отопления

actor User
participant "API Gateway" as API
participant "DeviceManager" as DeviceManager
participant "HeatingDriver" as Driver
participant "Relay Device" as Relay

User -> API: PUT /devices/heating/off
activate API
API -> DeviceManager: validateUserAccess()
activate DeviceManager
DeviceManager -> Driver: sendCommand(OFF)
activate Driver
Driver -> Relay: HTTP POST /off
activate Relay
Relay --> Driver: 200 OK
deactivate Relay
Driver --> DeviceManager: CommandResult
deactivate Driver
DeviceManager -> API: Ack
deactivate DeviceManager
API --> User: 202 Accepted
deactivate API
@enduml